1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,283
Semi modals supply the forms the nine modals lack.

2
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:07,135
Have to and had to for outside obligation.

3
00:00:07,135 --> 00:00:09,257
Be able to, in every tense.

4
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:11,705
Be allowed to for permission.

5
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:15,585
Used to for a past habit that has stopped: he used to smoke.

6
00:00:15,585 --> 00:00:17,890
Be supposed to, for what is expected.

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,388
And need and dare.

8
00:00:19,388 --> 00:00:25,820
Careful with one pair: I used to go means a past habit; I am used to going means I am accustomed to it.

